sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-bicyclus-anynana-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-bicyclus-anynana-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-bicyclus-anynana-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Sekimura et al. (2015) Gierer–Meinhardt wing-cell focus at λ_c = 1.507 mm (pass 2 controls) — MorphoEval overall 86.3/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 records the controls. Dispersion Pearson r = 0.9985, RMSE = 0.0063, KS = 0.056 on 18 wavenumbers. k_c = 6.190 and λ_c = 1.507 mm (0.001507 m, log10 = −2.822, Holocene 0 Ma). The one-wavelength cell at k_p = 0 has 1 focus; the same kinetics at width 2 λ_c have 2 foci; D2 = D1 sends k_c to 0; k_p = 2 has 0 foci. k_p = 1 still returns 2 foci, so the sweep is not monotone and is reported that way. Specimen segmentation finds 8 ocelli. The forewing white pupil used as Cu1 is at (578, 234), black-disc radius 11 px, gold radius 18 px. Specimen coherency 0.5207 versus last-frame coherency 0.5234. GIF CV similarity 71.1 on 12 frames at 960×640. Radial pigment Pearson r = 0.26, reported separately and not used as the wavelength gate. Overall 86.3/100 (faithfulness 84.7, reproducibility 90.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 68f7b12177b4371c73d1b9066a4410ed7696f94a; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 90, Morphological realism / specimen match 80, Parameter expressivity 84, Morphometric validation 86, Source and data traceability 92, Code-to-model traceability 88, Reproducibility package 90. Output judged: docs/media/bicyclus_anynana_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-bicyclus-anynana-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 68f7b12177b4371c73d1b9066a4410ed7696f94a, image/png, 910374 B, 1344×1008 px, artifact_sha256 352dd94d93ec4cc66b8d641ef0e404086a87707ba662ac380b09b7148a54b615 (sha256 352dd94d93ec4cc66b8d641ef0e404086a87707ba662ac380b09b7148a54b615), spec_fingerprint 3f5f93b10ee51771e8149aef602ac80bf975d9d9088f20c810dd83de83f7b77f. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 3f5f93b10ee51771e8149aef602ac80bf975d9d9088f20c810dd83de83f7b77f; artifact_sha256: 352dd94d93ec4cc66b8d641ef0e404086a87707ba662ac380b09b7148a54b615; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/bicyclus_anynana_turing_wavelength_s0/bicyclus_anynana_specimen.jpg=cc4f97c92c75001c..., datasets/bicyclus_anynana_turing_wavelength_s0/bicyclus_anynana_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=b5d0d5a8aa669f84..., datasets/bicyclus_anynana_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=fd0b8adc3491655c...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-bicyclus-anynana-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Eq. 3.1–3.2 and Table 1 of Sekimura et al. 2015. | Proximal activator level selects or suppresses the focus (Fig. 4). | Wider wing cells form more foci (S1 Appendix).; reconstructed_in_script: Finite-difference Eq. 3.1, analytical and numerical σ(k), k_p sweep, width doubling, equal-diffusion ablation. | λ_c fixed at 1.507 mm for this Holocene slot. | CV segmentation of the pinned specimen and a 12-frame growth GIF.; transfer_boundary: The 1.507 mm anchor is the slot scale. Sekimura et al. 2015 do not state that millimetre value. | Leaf and scale texture in the GIF are the photograph.; does_not_claim: That activator concentration equals pigment luminance (radial Pearson r = 0.26). | A second chronospecies. Width doubling is the scale contrast inside this single Holocene terminus. | A signed nanopublication.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R1', 'item': 'Resolved in this pass: k_p sweep and width doubling are scored. k_p = 0 and 0.5 give 1 focus, k_p = 2 gives 0, width 2 λ_c gives 2. The k_p = 1 bin (2 foci) is reported, not deleted.', 'status': 'resolved'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R2', 'item': 'Resolved in this pass: equal diffusion D2 = D1 moves k_c from 6.190 to 0.', 'status': 'resolved'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R3', 'item': 'Resolved in this pass: 8 ocelli segmented; Cu1 at (578, 234); coherency 0.5207 versus 0.5234. Reference values differ from measured values.', 'status': 'resolved'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R4', 'item': 'Resolved in this pass: dispersion Pearson r = 0.9985, RMSE = 0.0063, KS = 0.056. Radial pigment Pearson r = 0.26 is stored separately.', 'status': 'resolved'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R5', 'item': 'Still open: one assessor only.', 'status': 'open'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R6', 'item': 'Still open: signing unavailable without ~/.nanopub/profile.yml.', 'status': 'open'}" ;
        pk:hasScore "0.863"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor; no independent second assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

